        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wanda Jackson, Billy Gray\n- Works: \"My Big Iron Skillet\", \"You Can't Have My Love\"\n- Roles: country artist, rock artist, Christian artist, country musician\n- Concepts: Rockabilly titles\n\nFacts:\n- Wanda Jackson was an American country, rock, and Christian artist.\n- Wanda Jackson was known as the \"Queen of Rockabilly\" and the \"First Lady of Rockabilly.\"\n- \"My Big Iron Skillet\" was recorded and released as a single by Wanda Jackson.\n- \"You Can't Have My Love\" was recorded by Wanda Jackson and Billy Gray.\n- Billy Gray was an American country musician.",
